"Advanced: connect this app to any compatible Anky server. Writing and conversation go to that server only when you explicitly ask Anky." = "高级：将此 App 连接到任何兼容的 Anky 服务器。只有当你明确请求 Anky 时，书写和对话才会发送到该服务器。";
